sequenceDiagram
    participant R as Main (runtime)
    participant A as Arena
    participant OM as ObstacleMap
    participant T as Tank
    participant GE as GameEngine
    R->>OM: ObstacleMap.empty(); add(Position)
    R->>A: new Arena(width,height,obstacles)
    R->>T: new Tank(id, pos, orient, health) x2
    R->>GE: new GameEngine(Arena, List<Tank>)
    R->>GE: enqueue(tankId, Command)
    R->>GE: tick()
    GE->>GE: process commands (lexicographic ids, live only)
    GE->>GE: spawn projectiles for FIRE (if in bounds, not obstacle)
    GE->>GE: advance projectiles; detect collisions; update ScoreBoard
    R->>GE: getTanksCopy(); getProjectilesCopy(); getScoreBoardCopy()
    R-->>R: print one concise snapshot and exit